			'Exploratory learning for preschool and kindergarten through play, movement, communication and guided discovery.',
		labelId: 'Usia 3–6 tahun',
		labelEn: 'Ages 3–6',
		href: '/programs#early-learners',
	},
	{
		number: '02',
		titleId: 'Primary',
